        ":question/problem": "Calculate ${f}^{″}(x).$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${f}^{″}(x)\\,=\\,$ \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "We already know that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =-3{x}^{2}-6x+24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & ={(-3{x}^{2}-6x+24)}^{′} \\\\  & =-3\\cdot 2x-6\\cdot 1+0 \\\\  & =-6x-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
